# Add ballot ZIP or race

When the user asks to add a sample-ballot ZIP, a race, or a measure:

1. Read and follow `.cursor/skills/add-ballot-zip/SKILL.md` (general-election research & data standard).
2. Follow `.cursor/skills/site-build-changelog/SKILL.md` for `site-updates.ts` and `meta.ts`.

Do not ship contested races with bio-only candidates—every contested candidate needs a topical `scorecard`, and every measure needs the full `measure` block.
